DESCRIPTION:**Grab the whole family and join us for an afternoon of Oktobe
 rfest fun under the redwoods!**\n\n**We’re excited to welcome Sarah Gron
 quist\, a wonderfully versatile Bay Area musician bringing accordion\, voc
 als and plenty of personality to the Roadhouse. With a musical background 
 spanning swing\, tango\, gypsy jazz and accordion traditions\, Sarah is th
 e perfect soundtrack for an Oktoberfest celebration!**\n\n**And this one i
 s for ALL AGES! Bring the kids\, bring the grandparents and come ready to 
 play.**\n\n**🥨 Oktoberfest food specials 🍺 German beers & festive po
 urs 🪗 Live accordion music with Sarah Gronquist 🏆 Family-friendly ga
 mes\, contests & prizes 🎯 Fun for the kids AND grown-ups**\n\n**Come hu
 ngry\, grab a stein\, get in on the games and make an afternoon of it.**\n
 \n**PROST! 🍻🥨**\n\nFREE TO ATTEND
