DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T220000
UID:2609164KKr2klLt0ODQA1AuwZvVA
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a talent show with a little extra spark! Highly 
 Talented takes over The Lounge at Mercy on Saturday\, September 26 for 
 a night of live performances\, crowd participation\, cannabis\, and seriou
 sly entertaining local talent. Sponsored by our friends at Soma Rosa Farms
 \, Halara Vapes\, and Mercy Wellness.\n\nSingers\, dancers\, comedians\, m
 usicians\, specialty acts\, and more will take the stage and show us what 
 they’ve got. With live judges and an audience vote\, you won’t just b
 e watching the show—you’ll be part of deciding who comes out on top.\n
 \nThe top performer gets $500 and will be featured in upcoming Mercy Wel
 lness email marketing. Think you've got what it takes to win?? Sign up her
 e for a shot at performing: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdhFt
 XvM6Z5InoYlcBwB4LZAgHku9gZ1ASYTOZRL3FvRMeqOA/viewform?usp=header\n\nCome e
 arly\, get settled in\, enjoy the lounge\, and get ready to cheer on your 
 favorites when the show starts.\n\nDate & Time\n\nDate: Saturday\, Septem
 ber 26\, 2026\n\nPre-Party: 6:00 PM\n\nTalent Show: 7:00 PM – 10:00 PM
 \n\nWhat to Expect\n\n🎤 Live Performances\n\nWatch local performers br
 ing their best to the Highly Talented stage.\n\n⭐ Live Judges\n\nOur ju
 dges will be watching\, reacting\, and helping narrow down the competition
 .\n\n👏 Audience Vote\n\nThe crowd gets a say. Come ready to support yo
 ur favorite act and help decide who rises to the top.\n\n💰 Winner Gets
  $500\n\nOne performer will leave the stage with bigger pockets and a feat
 ure in upcoming Mercy Wellness email marketing.\n\n🌿 An Elevated Night
  Out\n\nEnjoy the show inside The Lounge at Mercy with good people\, great
  entertainment\, and even better smoke.\n\nTickets\n\n🐦 Early Bird Gene
 ral Admission — Available Through September 4\n\nLock in early bird pric
 ing for general admission before it’s gone.\n\n🎟 General Admission\n\
 nEntry to Highly Talented with access to the full talent show from 6–1
 0 PM.\n\nSeating is subject to availability\, so arrive early\, get comfor
 table\, and settle in before the performances begin.\n\nThink You’re Hig
 hly Talented?\n\nWe’re still looking for performers to take the stage.\n
 \nAudition sign-ups close September 18.\n\nContestants who sign up receive
 :\n\n✨ A goodie bag\n\n🎟 One additional General Admission ticket for 
 a guest\n\n💰 The opportunity to get $500\n\n📧 A feature in upcoming
  Mercy Wellness email marketing if selected as the winner\n\nAudition regi
 stration and talent submission are handled separately from General Admissi
 on tickets.\n\nA Talent Show With a Little Extra Spark.\n\n21\\+ Only | DC
 C \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Conditions\n\nThis event is 21\\+ 
 only. A valid government-issued ID is required for entry.\n\nBy attending 
 an event at The Lounge at Mercy\, you acknowledge that photography and vi
 deo recording may occur. Images and video captured during the event may be
  used by Mercy Wellness for marketing and promotional purposes without com
 pensation.\n\nTickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event de
 tails\, performers\, timing\, judging\, and programming are subject to cha
 nge without notice.\n\nCannabis consumption is permitted only in designate
 d areas and must comply with all applicable local and state regulations. P
 lease consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue\, you agree to comply 
 with all venue policies and house rules.
LOCATION:The Loung at Mercy
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/mercys-highly-talented-14966
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
