UID:2609024bv2r8ZfXUqruzrtRGhRtA
DESCRIPTION:Learn the foundations of tapestry weaving with Hanna “The Wo
 ol Witch” in this beginner-friendly lap loom workshop. You’ll learn ho
 w to set up and warp a loom before experimenting with yarn\, wool roving\,
  denim scraps\, and other fibers to create texture and dimension in your o
 wn woven wall hanging.\n\nIn this workshop\, you’ll:\n\n• Learn how to
  prepare and warp a wooden lap loom\n\n• Practice foundational tapestry 
 weaving techniques\n\n• Experiment with different fibers\, materials\, a
 nd textures\n\n• Create your own woven wall tapestry\n\nTake home both y
 our finished tapestry and the wooden lap loom you learned on so you can co
 ntinue weaving
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
