DESCRIPTION:WHEN:          Sunday\, September 27\, 2026\n\n  
                       2:30 p.m. Social Hour   4:0
 0 p.m. dinner served\n\n WHO:             Penngrove Social F
 iremen \n\n WHAT:           Hawaiian Luau – with Kalua Pork
  & all the fixings\n\n WHERE:         Penngrove Park\, 11800 Mai
 n St - downtown Penngrove \n\n WHY:             Proceeds be
 nefit Penngrove Park's new playground for the littles.\n\nTICKETS: Pre-sal
 e tickets: Adults $30\; children ages 12 and under $15\; Free for ages 5 a
 nd under.  Available at Penngrove Market\, 10070 Main Street in Penngrov
 e\, or call 707-318-2191. Eventbrite Link to buy online: https://Luau\\_P
 enngrove.eventbrite.com \n\n CONTACT: (707) 318-2191\, or www.penngroves
 ocialfiremen.org\n\n **HAWAIIAN LUAU at Penngrove Park – Sunday\, Septe
 mber 27\, 2026**\n\n Penngrove Social Firemen present the Hawaiian Luau a
 t Penngrove Park on  Sunday\, September 27\, 2026.\n\n Enjoy a Hawaiian
  dinner and a performance by the Taimalietane Islands of Polynesia dancer
 s. The costumes and performance of this all-age troupe is authentic and in
 spiring.\n\n Social hour is at 2:30 p.m.\, with dinner at 4:00 p.m.\n\n 
 The menu features Penngrove Social Firemen’s talented volunteer chefs\, 
 making kalua pork\, Fried Rice\, Asian salad\, Hawaiian chicken\, and dess
 ert. \n\n Wear your best Hawaiian shirt and lei. Immerse yourself in the
  island spirit.  Bring your friends and family for the laughter and good 
 vibes.  Let's hula the day away together at our Hawaiian Luau!\n\n Proce
 eds will go to the new playground fund for the littles.\n\nPre-sale ticke
 ts: Adults $30\; children 12 and under $15\; Free for ages 5 and under. 
  Available at Penngrove Market\, 10070 Main Street in Penngrove\, or ca
 ll 707-318-2191. Link to buy online tickets: \n\nhttps://Luau\\_Penngrove
 .eventbrite.com \n\n Penngrove Social Firemen was formed in 1946 to supp
 ort the community. The non-profit group owns and maintains the Penngrove P
 ark and Penngrove Community Club for the enjoyment of all. Members need no
 t reside in Penngrove.\n\n For more information\, contact 707-318-2191 or
  see www.penngrovesocialfiremen.org
LOCATION:Penngrove Park
URL:https://Luau_Penngrove.eventbrite.com 
