  with like-minded folks at the beautiful Rodney Strong Vineyards. We welco
 me guests ages 16+ to join us.\n\nOptional activities include: a guided se
 nsory tasting of Rodney Strong’s wine varieties\, a vineyard walk to enj
 oy the scenery and fresh valley air\, intentional art with local artist Do
 nna Marchesano\, and classic board games and puzzles.\n\n*Wine\, non-alcoh
 olic mocktails\, cheese and charcuterie will be available for purchase. Ou
 tside food permitted.*
