BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wine Down Sundays with LIVE Music
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T180000
UID:260916Xl_UxOL4FEGXxBNnsWiF7Q
DESCRIPTION:Wine Down Sundays at Region are all about ending the weekend o
 n the right note.\n\nJoin us for live music with our local favorite Sean C
 arscadden\, a featured winery experience\, and a relaxed afternoon filled 
 with exceptional wines\, great conversation\, and the kind of atmosphere t
 hat makes you want to stay awhile.\n\nCreated for those moments when you w
 ant to linger a little longer\, Sundays at Region bring together the best 
 parts of wine country—discovering new wines\, enjoying live music\, and 
 sharing time with the people who matter most.\n\nWhether you’re catching
  up with friends\, welcoming visiting family\, or simply looking for a pla
 ce to unwind\, Wine Down Sundays are your invitation to sip\, settle in\, 
 and enjoy the final moments of the weekend.\n\nLive Music Feature: Sean Ca
 rscadden\n\nFeatured Winery: LIOCO\n\nWho we are:\n\nRegion is your gatewa
 y to exploring the best local wine\, offering over 50+ wines available by 
 the taste\, glass or bottle from 44 local Sonoma County Winery Partners. W
 e are here to craft relationships between the drinkers and the makers - wh
 ether you are new to the world of wine or are a seasoned pro\, there is al
 ways something new to discover...and the chance to meet our winemakers!\n\
 nWe have lunch and dinner menus available to order from\, and for those no
 t interested in wine we have beer\, cider\, aperol & hugo spritz\, and spi
 rit free cocktails from Land + Local. Kid and pet friendly!
LOCATION:Region.
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/regionsonoma/event/620149/live-music-wine-
 down-sundays-at-region
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
