BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:River & Redwoods Film Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T000000
UID:260713ePv4VyyPdEusNOjJQsP9Bg
DESCRIPTION:The River & Redwoods Film Festival returns to Monte Rio for a 
 special weekend celebrating independent film\, creativity\, community\, an
 d the natural beauty of Northern California. Set among the towering redwoo
 ds and along the banks of the Russian River\, the festival brings filmmake
 rs\, film lovers\, artists\, and locals together for three unforgettable d
 ays of screenings\, conversations\, live events\, and connection. Hosted a
 t the historic Monte Rio Theater and neighboring venues in Monte Rio\, Cal
 ifornia\, River & Redwoods showcases narrative films\, documentaries\, sho
 rts\, student films\, and emerging voices from the Bay Area and beyond. Mo
 re than just a film festival\, River & Redwoods is about gathering in a be
 autiful small-town setting to experience great storytelling together. Expe
 ct filmmaker Q&As\, outdoor gatherings\, music\, local food and drink\, an
 d the laid-back creative spirit of Sonoma County. Whether you're an indust
 ry professional\, aspiring filmmaker\, or simply someone who loves movies 
 under the redwoods\, we invite you to spend the weekend with us.
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/river-redwoods-film-festival/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sundays in Sonoma at Viansa Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T000000
UID:260624davSypcL00-LJOY81kMcVA
DESCRIPTION:Viansa Winery feels made for live music\, perched atop the Sum
 mit of Sonoma with sweeping vineyard views and Tuscan-inspired charm. This
  summer and fall\, acclaimed singer-songwriter Greg Lamboy brings his warm
 \, intimate sound to the hilltop terrace for select afternoon performances
  as part of Viansa's outdoor music series. An award-winning guitarist and 
 frontman of the Americana band Pacific Standard\, Lamboy is known for pitc
 h-perfect melodies and deeply personal lyrics. His relaxed\, soulful style
  pairs effortlessly with Viansa's panoramic setting\, estate wines\, and l
 aid-back elegance. Settle in with a tasting\, take in the views\, and enjo
 y an afternoon where strong vocals\, masterful guitar\, and unforgettable 
 songs rise above the everyday. Performance Dates: June 14\, June 21\, July
  12\, July 19\, July 26\, October 4\, and October 18 from 12 pm -3 pm.
LOCATION:Viansa Winery
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/sundays-in-sonoma-at-viansa-winery/
