DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T170000
UID:260805H415KKSQRU2o6In-VXorjQ
DESCRIPTION:We want to hear from you!\n\nBuilt by early settlers in 1874\,
  the Tomales Town Hall is one of the oldest continually used community bui
 ldings in California. We're a 501(c)3 non-profit with a 152-year-old build
 ing at the heart of the village of Tomales.\n\nCome to our community check
 -in. The trustees of the town hall would like to share our upcoming event 
 calendar\, programs\, finances\, progress on renovation\, and volunteer op
 portunities. This is your chance to give us feedback. We'll have a hosted 
 bar and some nibbles.
