DESCRIPTION:The younger generation of this group features Rico Jones on sa
 xophone and Wallace Roney Jr. on trumpet who are both representations of p
 romising artists of the next generation where they are forging new paths w
 hile simultaneously grounded in the jazz tradition. The elders of the of t
 he group are David Kikoski on piano\, Essiet Okon Essiet on bass\, and Syl
 via Cuenca on drums who will be sharing their masterly years of extensive 
