BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rick Mariani to present at the Napa Valley Photographic Society
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T203000
UID:260921OijI7JgZbUy6oXEWVmr90Q
DESCRIPTION:Please join fellow photography enthusiasts for Rick Mariani’
 s presentation on commercial food and product photography.\n\nRick Mariani
  Photography is a commercial photo studio.  Rick specializes in photograp
 hing products\, food\, and wine for many wineries\, food companies\, marke
 ting agencies\, magazines\, graphic design firms\, and ad agencies.  He h
 as photographed scores of covers and the monthly food menu for The Wine Sp
 ectator magazine for 12 years. After many years working with wine-related 
 clients\, he has an extensive knowledge of wine and the industry.  Look f
 or Rick’s work on Instagram at “rickspix.”\n\nPreviously\, Rick was 
 an Adjunct Professor of Photography at Solano Community College\, where he
  taught one or two classes each semester\, including Product Photography\,
  Architectural Photography\, and Portraiture.  He taught similar classes 
 at Napa Valley College as well.  \n\nEarly in his career\, Rick was a Sta
 ff Photographer for MediaWest in San Francisco\, a multimedia production c
 ompany.  There were many corporate clients and projects included audio-vi
 sual multi-projector slide shows.  Rick did all the photography as well a
 s the set-up of projectors and screens and sound systems for meetings or p
 ermanent installations.  Rick literally traveled around the world to take
  photos and set up productions.\n\nRick will critique member photos.  The
  assignment is to photograph a product in an interesting environment\, a p
 roduct with food\, or just photograph food either prepared or raw.  Criti
 que will focus on concept\, composition\, lighting\, and chosen depth of f
 ocus.  \n\nNapa Valley Photographic Society (NVPS) promotes the art and s
 cience of photography\, providing education\, image appreciation\, inspira
 tion\, and exchange of technologies. Most months\, we invite guest speaker
 s to evaluate our images.  Guests are welcome to attend.  Check the webs
 ite for more information: http://www.napavalleyphotographicsociety.org.
LOCATION:Napa Senior Center
URL:http://www.napavalleyphotographicsociety.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
