 r little ones. This ongoing\, FREE drop-in group is a welcoming place to c
 onnect\, share\, listen\, and simply be during the early years of parentho
 od. Led by licensed therapist Ashley Travis and Ali Vogt\, LMFT\, the grou
 p is open to families from pregnancy through age 3. Need to Know Thursdays
  | 11:00 AM-12:30 PM Fairfax Pavilion Pregnancy through age 3 Drop-in - Fr
 ee - No cost to attend Come reconnect with familiar faces\, meet other new
  parents\, and help us celebrate the return of this wonderful community ga
 thering to the Pavilion. Bring your baby or toddler-and come as you are. W
 e can't wait to welcome you home! About the Program: Special Welcome-Back 
 Day - October 1 To celebrate our return to the Pavilion\, we're adding a f
 ew extra touches to make this morning feel special: Mini Prenatal & Postna
 tal Massages Parents can enjoy a complimentary 15-20 minute massage sessio
 n-a little time to pause\, breathe\, and take care of yourself\, too. Tea 
