BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mercy Presents: The Beatles Reimagined by Jazz Mafia and Otis McDo
 nald
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T213000
UID:260916M32SYCD850CYWoR3Jfr7ig
DESCRIPTION:MERCY PRESENTS:\n\nThe Beatles Reimagined\n\nJazz Mafia featur
 ing Otis McDonald\n\nCome together for a one-of-a-kind night celebrating t
 he music that changed everything.\n\nSponsored by Mercy Wellness and Turn\
 , Jazz Mafia featuring Otis McDonald takes The Beatles’ legendary catalo
 g somewhere entirely new—reimagining familiar melodies through jazz\, fu
 nk\, soul\, hip-hop\, and the unmistakable energy of a live Jazz Mafia per
 formance.\n\nFrom Yesterday to Come Together\, Something to Across the Uni
 verse\, songs you’ve known for a lifetime are transformed into something
  unexpected\, alive\, and made for right now.\n\nArrive early for the pre-
 party at 6 PM\, then settle in as the main performance takes the stage fro
 m 7–10 PM.\n\nDate & Time\n\nFriday\, October 2\, 2026\n\nPre-Party · 6
  PM\n\nMain Show · 7–10 PM\n\nCome together. Hear it differently. \n\n2
 1\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Conditions\n\nThis ev
 ent is 21\\+ only. Valid government-issued ID is required for entry. By at
 tending this event at the Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that pho
 tography and video recording may take place. Images and footage may be use
 d by Mercy Wellness for marketing and promotional purposes across various 
 channels\, without compensation. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwi
 se stated. Event details\, timing\, or programming are subject to change.\
 n\nCannabis consumption is limited to designated areas and must comply wit
 h all applicable local and state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\
 n\nBy entering the venue\, you agree to comply with all house rules and ve
 nue policies.
LOCATION:The Loung at Mercy
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/the-lounge-at-mercy-14985
