DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T020000
UID:260723aizX9QBnJEOVqsVPxp0CpA
DESCRIPTION:Saturday afternoons hit differently at Barrel Proof Lounge.\n\
 nWe open early — 3pm — and hand the room over to Ukulele Ramblers\, a 
 friendly\, talented ukulele collective that turns Happy Hour into a laid-b
 ack\, sing-along hang.\n\nThis is live music and an open uke jam. Bring yo
 ur ukulele if you’ve got one. Bring your voice even if you don’t. The 
 Ramblers lead the way with familiar tunes\, easy harmonies\, and a welcomi
 ng vibe that makes it just as fun to join in as it is to sit back and list
 en.\n\nNo pressure. No ego. Just good songs\, good people\, and a room tha
 t feels like it belongs to everyone.\n\n Live Music & Open Uke Jam | 3–
 6pm  Happy Hour drinks  Free popcorn  21+\n\n Barrel Proof Lounge 501 
 Mendocino Avenue\, Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nIt’s the kind of afternoon you
  plan to stop by for one drink… and somehow stay for three hours.\n\n**w
 ww.UkuleleRamblers.net**\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for al
 l sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/late-night-karaoke-afte
 r-party-friday-nights-after-comedy/18691979/2026-10-02T22
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mercy Presents: Last Mic Standing Comedy Showdown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T220000
UID:260701htlPrxM63EeEW_Oh7pXXNA
DESCRIPTION:**Battle for the Main Stage.**\n\nEight fearless comics step i
 nto the spotlight for one night of rapid-fire punchlines\, crowd reactions
 \, and high-stakes humor inside The Lounge at Mercy.\n\nThis isn’t an op
 en mic. This is a showdown.\n\n**8 Comics. 3 Judges. Audience Vote.**\n\nE
 ach comedian brings their sharpest material and strongest stage presence t
 o compete for the title of Last Mic Standing. Judges score the sets. The c
 rowd weighs in. The energy decides everything.\n\nOne night. One winner.\n
 \nThe stakes are real. The winner takes home a $100 cash prize and earns a
  paid hosting spot at the next Mercy’s Tokes & Jokes Comedy Night. Win t
 he crowd. Own the mic. Come back as host.\n\nThis is a 420-friendly comedy
  competition hosted inside our fully licensed cannabis consumption lounge\
 , where elevated vibes meet elevated punchlines. Guests are welcome to enj
 oy responsibly while comics go head-to-head under the lights. Great sets h
 it differently here.\n\n**Date & Time**\n\n**Date:** First Friday of Every
  Month\n\n**Time:** 8:00 PM – 9:30 PM\n\n**Doors Open:** 6:00 PM\n\n**Ti
 cket Tiers**\n\n**$20 — General Admission (Open Seating)** Entry to Come
 dy Showdown 🎤 Open seating (first come\, first served). Come early for 
 the best spot.\n\n**$30 — GA + Goodie Bag** A little extra ✨ Entry + g
 oodie bag ($15 value) included. Open seating (first come\, first served).
  \n\n**⭐ $40 — Preferred Bucket Seat + Goodie Bag (Most Popular)** Co
 mfort upgrade ⭐ Guaranteed bucket seat + shared table access\, plus good
 ie bag ($15 value) included. Limited seating.\n\n**🔥 $135 — Couch Cre
 w Pass (3 Guests + Premium Bag)** Bring your crew 🔥 Includes admission 
 for 3 guests\, reserved couch seating with a dedicated table\, plus premiu
 m bag ($100 value) included. **Only 11 couches.**\n\n21+ Only | DCC # C12-
 0000420-LIC\n\n**Event Terms & Conditions**\n\nThis event is 21+ only. Val
 id government-issued ID is required for entry. By attending this event at 
 the Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video rec
 ording may take place. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellness fo
 r marketing and promotional purposes across various channels\, without com
 pensation. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event detai
 ls\, timing\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumptio
 n is limited to designated areas and must comply with all applicable local
  and state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the ven
 ue\, you agree to comply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://mercywellness.com/tokes-n-jokes-comedy-night
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Collectors Lunch Pairing at Lynmar Estate
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T143000
UID:260626Z9WfKGYIz0m8KMdG_bDccg
DESCRIPTION:Rooted in the bounty of Quail Hill Vineyard\, Lynmar Estate’
 s Summer Collectors Lunch Pairing invites guests to experience the flavors
  of Sonoma County at their seasonal peak. The elevated four-course menu sh
 owcases ingredients harvested from Lynmar’s organically farmed gardens\,
  orchards\, and olive groves. Each course is individually plated and thoug
 htfully paired with Lynmar’s acclaimed estate-grown Pinot Noirs\, Chardo
 nnays\, and sparkling wines\, creating a journey that is both deeply conne
 cted to Sonoma County and globally inspired. Served in the idyllic setting
  of Quail Hill Vineyard\, the experience is further enhanced by a special 
 tableside visit from Estate Chef David Frakes.\n\nCollectors Lunch Pairing
  Menu Summer 2026:\n\nAdam’s Vineyard Chardonnay\, 2022\n\nWarm Organic 
 Popcorn\n\n*White Corn-Kasundi Salt\, Estate Extra-Virgin Olive Oil*\n\nSu
 sanna’s Vineyard Chardonnay\, 2022\n\nThai Green Curry & Coconut Soup\n\
 n*Bliss Snap Peas & Heirloom Radish*\n\nYoung Vines Pinot Noir\, 2021\n\nH
 eirloom Potato & Cherry Tomato ‘Croustade’\n\n*Smoked Bacon-Grain Must
 ard Dressing*\n\nSusanna’s Vineyard Pinot Noir\, 2022\n\nRoasted Syrian 
 Seven-Spiced Chicken Breast\n\n*Indonesian Corn Fritter\, Summer Vegetable
  Ragout\, Balado Sauce*\n\nRosé de Blancs Sparkling\, 2021\n\nChilled Van
 illa Burnt Basque Cheesecake\n\n*Raspberry-Rose Syrup\, Black Tea & Licori
 ce-Poached Cherries*\n\n*Brown Butter Nilla Cookie\, Candied Lime*\n\n**Es
 tate Ingredients:**\n\nBay Laurel\, Cherries\, Chives\, Edible Flowers\, L
 emons\, Olive Oil\, Peas\, Potatoes\, Radishes\, Raspberries\, Thyme\, Tom
 atoes\, Zucchini and more!\n\nMenu by Estate Chef David Frakes\n\nReservat
 ions are required. Maximum group size is six guests.
LOCATION:Lynmar Estate 
URL:https://lynmarestate.com/reservation/type/collectors-lunch-pairing/ 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
