SUMMARY:Simchat Torah Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T190000
UID:260916VAc5qDPCvkyUWHg4UKrsKQ
DESCRIPTION:On Simchat Torah we celebrate the completion of the yearly Tor
 ah cycle.\n\nThis joyous milestone is marked by dancing with the Torah.\n\
 nThis year will be a special celebration as we will be remembering for th
 e victims of the October 7th attacks\, the Hebrew date having been Simchat
  Torah. We cried for them. We prayed for them.  And now we will dance for
  them.\n\nDelicious buffet dinner with singing\, dancing\, joy and L'chaim
 \n\n**Saturday\, October 3\, 7:00 pm**
LOCATION:Chabad Jewish Center of Petaluma 
URL:https://www.jewishpetaluma.com/templates/articlecco_cdo/aid/5660754/je
 wish/Simchat-Torah-Celebration.htm
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Adam Lieb
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T180000
UID:260915_ikMTkeTOUaInZUKBvmu4Q
DESCRIPTION:Join us for live music in our tasting room! Reserve your spot 
 for this Saturday Live Music & Tasting Experience\, where exceptional win
 es\, laid-back vibes\, and great live music come together for an unforgett
 able afternoon.\n\n**Featured Band**\n\nAdam Lieb Blending rock\, blues\, 
 soul\, and global folk influences\, singer-songwriter and guitarist Adam 
 Lieb delivers music infused with passion\, craftsmanship\, and deep cultu
 ral roots. A Brooklyn native now based in Northern California\, Adam’s d
 ynamic performances — whether solo or with his Disorderly House Band —
  showcase a lifetime of musical exploration\, from touring with Robert Fri
 pp’s League of Crafty Guitarists to recording at Abbey Road Studios.\n\n
 **Details**\n\nWalk-ins are welcome\, but priority seating is given to win
 e club members and guests with reservations. This event tends to fill up q
 uickly\, so we highly recommend making a reservation to secure your table.
  No outside food is allowed\, but we are dog and family friendly. For larg
 e groups of 13 or more\, please email us at visit@spicyvines.com.
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/events/live-music-by-adam-lieb-16/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Emilia
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T221500
UID:2609154pcPXVF-7E23m4mJFBn64Q
DESCRIPTION:Emilia by Morgan Lloyd Malcolm is a passionate\, feminist rei
 magining of the life of 17th-century poet and musician Emilia Bassano. The
  play\, performed by an all-female cast\, delves into her journey from a p
 rivileged childhood\, to becoming a trailblazing poet\, and a woman fighti
 ng for her say in a male-dominated world.
LOCATION:SRJC Burbank Auditorium
URL:https://srjc.universitytickets.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
