UID:260625Wi6zvZ7HLUqbREgBUhshKA
DESCRIPTION:Join us on October 3\, 2026 for the Ripp’n River Bash\, 
 a signature fundraising celebration in support of Russian Riverkeeper—br
 inging together neighbors\, environmental champions\, and local leaders fo
 r one extraordinary night dedicated to protecting the Russian River.  \n
 \nEvening Highlights: Cocktails & Appeitizers in the Grange Courtyard\n\nC
 harlie Palmer - Inspired Dinner Experience\n\nParking:  Self-parking and
  complimentary valet service will be available.\n\n$475.00 per person \\(s
 ee ticket link for other options\\)\n\nYou can also mail a check to the ad
 dress below. Please include your name\, guest names. and number of tickets
 .\n\nRussian Riverkeeper P.O. Box 1335 Healdsburg\, CA 95448 info@russianr
 iverkeeper.org Phone: \\(707\\) 433-1958
