 on on Saturday\, October 3rd where you'll enjoy selected readings by the p
 oets and the exhibit of paired works. Poets and Artists included in this e
 xhibit: Suze Cohan Marylu Downing Andrea van Dyke Sarah Dupre Patrick Fann
 ing Steve Fowler Elizabeth Herron Rich Levin Diane masura Jessica Morell S
