BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Celebrate Our Stars
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T203000
UID:260820U6_w-XSF5UesDt8SSC_Btw
DESCRIPTION:An unforgettable evening presented by the Safari West Zoologic
 al Society\, supporting the extraordinary animals in our care. Meet the re
 markable animals of Safari West and discover the stories behind their name
 s VIP: $450 per person | $350 per person WHAT TO EXPECT Celebrate Our Star
 s is not a traditional gala. From the moment you arrive\, you will become 
 part of an immersive journey through Safari West—filled with special ani
 mal encounters\, small-group adventures\, and plenty of time with the rema
 rkable animals we have come together to celebrate. Enjoy wine and refreshm
 ents as you explore\, followed by a chef-prepared dinner and an evening of
  unforgettable animal stories. Guests will also have an opportunity to tak
 e part in our silent and live auctions and help make the Safari West Veter
 inary Hospital possible. Vegetarian and vegan entrées will be available. 
 Please let us know about any dietary restrictions when you respond. VIP EX
 PERIENCE Begin the evening by stepping inside the story of Safari West. Jo
 in Nancy and Peter Lang for an intimate gathering in the founders’ origi
 nal home\, with food and wine and a special animal encounter. A rare and p
 ersonal beginning to a truly memorable evening. The VIP Experience begins 
 at 2:30 p.m. SAFARI CHIC Festive\, comfortable\, and ready for a little ad
 venture. Comfortable shoes and layers are strongly encouraged\, as much of
  the experience will take place outdoors and around the preserve. STAY THE
  NIGHT A limited number of Safari West tent cabins are available for gala 
 guests at an additional cost. Lodging must be reserved separately and cann
 ot be booked online. Please call Reservations at 707-566-3661 and mention 
 Celebrate Our Stars when booking. SPONSORSHIP OPPORTUNITIES Celebrate Our 
 Stars sponsorships offer another meaningful way to help build the Safari W
 est Veterinary Hospital\, with special Safari West experiences created for
  families\, companies\, and organizations.  QUESTIONS? Please email Jen Lu
 mmus at jlummus@SafariWest.org
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2216700818906603/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
