  Sonoma\, CA 95476\n\nADMISSION:Free & Open to the PublicShop only – no 
 donations day of\n\nSonoma Community Center partners with **Refill Madness
 ** to bring Sonoma Valley its largest clothing swap\, twice a year. Fashio
 n accounts for roughly **10% of global greenhouse gas emissions every year
 **\, plus an enormous amount of landfill waste. Swapping is one of the eas
 iest ways to shrink that footprint – you go home with clothes you’ll a
 ctually wear\, and the things you don’t wear find someone who will.Cloth
 ing\, shoes and accessories in **all sizes\, genders and styles** are wa
 rmly welcomed.
