 plore Ahavat Yisrael\, show kindness to animals and care for the world aro
 und us—discovering along the way just how much good even little hands ca
 n do.\n\nAnd we'll still bake\, build\, create\, taste and celebrate our w
 ay through the Jewish year\, experiencing holidays and traditions in ways 
 kids can see\, touch and do.\n\n**Judaism comes to life\, one mitzvah at a
  time!**
