 e forum.\n\nMon\, Oct 5\, 7:15 PM: Healdsburg City Council\, District 2\n\
 n**Hear directly from candidates in Sonoma County and ask your own questio
 ns live on Zoom. Hosted by the League of Women Voters of Sonoma County**\,
  a nonpartisan\, nonprofit organization dedication to voter education.\n\n
 Find your city's forum on our event calendar at lwvsonoma.org for Zoom web
 inar links and details. Click the event on the calendar for full details. 
 All forums will be posted to our YouTube channel after each forum.\n\n**Al
 l Sonoma County forums**\n\nMon\, Sept 28\, 6:00 PM: Sonoma City Council\,
  District 1\n\nTue\, Sept 29\, 6:00 PM: Cloverdale City Council\, 3 seats\
 n\nWed\, Sept 30\, 6:00 PM: Windsor Mayor and Town Council\, District 1\n\
 nThu\, Oct 1\, 6:00 PM: Sebastopol City Council\, 3 seats\n\nMon\, Oct 5\,
  7:15 PM: Healdsburg City Council\, District 2\n\nWed\, Oct 7\, 6:00 PM: S
 anta Rosa City Council\, District 4\n\nThu\, Oct 8\, 6:00 PM: Rohnert Park
  City Council\, Districts 2 and 5\n\nAlso check out these forums from our 
 partners this October: • KRCB\, for local broadcasts of Sonoma County Su
 pervisor forums • AAUW Petaluma\, for Petaluma Mayor and City Council fo
 rums
LOCATION:Zoom Webinar
