DESCRIPTION:Join us on the first Tuesday of each month at 12:00 pm as we d
 iscuss different books! Print Copies will be available in the branch a mon
 th before the discussion. Please call or email the library with any questi
 ons. Book Club titles and dates are subject to change. For up to date info
 rmation visit: sonomalibrary.org/bookclubs 2026 Schedule: January 6 - The 
 Return: Fathers\, Sons\, and the Land by Hishan Matar February 3 - The Mid
 night Feast by Lucy Foley March 3 - Oranges Are Not the Only Fruit by Jean
 ette Winterson April 7 - Beautyland by Marie-Helene Bertino May 5 - The Be
 rry Pickers by Amanda Peters June 2 - How to Solve your own Murder by Kris
 ten Perrin July 7 - The Measure by Nikki Erlick August 4 - The Safekeep by
  Yael Van Dear Wouden September 1 - The Secret War of Julia Child by Diana
  Chambers October 6 - Mad Honey by Jodi Picoult November 3 - All the Color
 s of the Dark by Chris Whitaker December 1 - Eager by Ben Goldfarb
LOCATION:Healdsburg Library
URL:https://events.sonomalibrary.org/event/healdsburg-book-club-92077
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
