UID:260925OmvuHWwM3U-_ZNJNCF4bXQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an incredible night of reggae music in Healdsburg 
 on Friday Oct 9th with one of Nor Cal's premiere reggae bands: Dubcraft!\n
 \nThe party will be kicking off at 8pm sharp! $15 at the door | 21+\n\nDUB
 CRAFT: Based out of Northern California\, Dubcraft does reggae their own w
 ay – delivering a unique blend of both vintage and modern sounds that ar
 e specifically crafted to catch the listener’s ear. Influenced heavily b
 y Jamaican and European-based “Rub-a-dub” music\, getting the crowd en
 gaged\, dancing\, and singing along is their primary goal. Incorporating h
 ypnotizing dub sections\, catchy melodies\, and crowd participation\, Dubc
 raft puts on explosive live performances that always leave the crowd wanti
 ng more. Currently performing as a 6-piece band\, they are guaranteed to d
 eliver a high-energy\, heavy hitting performance every time they hit the s
 tage.
LOCATION:Elephant In The Room
URL:https://www.elephantintheroompub.com/music-calendar.html
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
