BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:H&L Live: The Dans of Steel
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T153000
UID:260922bsCaOtUU5k6pnZay8gVHLw
DESCRIPTION:H&L Live: The Dans of Steel\n\nHook & Ladder Live welcomes The
  Dans of Steel — a Bay Area tribute band celebrating the music of Steely
  Dan\, the prolific American rock band founded in 1972 by masterminds Dona
 ld Fagen and Walter Becker.\n\nStarted in 2017\, The Dans of Steel bring t
 ogether five deeply soulful musicians — Waddell Bell\, Ronnie Smith\, Da
 ve Shul\, Malcolm Marshall\, and Raliegh Neal — who explore\, "funkafy\,
 " and lovingly recreate songs from throughout the Steely Dan canon\, weavi
 ng together jazz\, rock\, and R&B sensibilities.\n\n🍷 Wine Club Perk: U
 p to 4 member guests receive a complimentary glass of Chill Red or Estate 
 Sauvignon Blanc on arrival.\n\n‍What to Know:\n\nAdmission is free - jus
 t show up and enjoy\n\nFood - fresh brick over pizza for purchase\n\nOutdo
 or seating - lawn and picnic area available \\(bring blankets encouraged\\
 )\n\nAll ages welcome - family-friendly event\n\nWine available for purcha
 se by the glass or bottle\n\nThis is H&L Live at its best: world-class mus
 icians\, golden hour timing\, and the Russian River Valley as your backdro
 p. Come early\, stay late\, and experience why the North Bay music scene i
 s legendary.
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/hl-live-the-dans-of-steel
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
