DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T160000
UID:260830ocC7r2GkpE2-gw4VeoW3MA
DESCRIPTION:“The Blues” Juried Show 2026 • How does Blue inspire yo
 u?\, Is it the color\, the mood\, the music \, the planet or ... ? Let you
 r imagination embrace The Blues.\n\nShow Dates: September 17\, 2026 - Octo
 ber 25\, 2026\n\nJuror: TBA\n\nArtists Reception: Saturday\, September 19
 \, 2025\, 1pm - 4pm
