SUMMARY:TELL ME ABOUT JOY\, in-store author event and book signing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T160000
UID:260925lei2jiYkdEmZRA_eg57mDw
DESCRIPTION:Come join us with the lovely author Kara Kavensky in a signing
  for her newest book *Tell Me About Joy.* A true story about the lives we 
 live\, the choices we carry\, and the unexpected ways love can find us aga
 in-even after all this time. Any readers that are a fan of Eat\, Pray\, L
 ove\, Tuesdays With Morrie and Untamed\, will absolutely ove this book! Se
 e you there.
LOCATION:Barnes and Noble (The Rosenberg Building) 
URL:https://stores.barnesandnoble.com/event/9780062223282-0
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
