DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T100000
UID:260127KmzBt9HfdUeks03_Zdk2JA
DESCRIPTION:A beloved CraftWork Healdsburg tradition - your best way to co
 nnect with the CraftWork community.\n\nRSVP\, join us for breakfast\, and 
 see where the Monday morning takes you - make a friend\, discover a local 
 business\, swap ideas\, connect with fellow coworkers at CraftWork coworki
 ng\, or meet someone unexpected. Some weeks it’s a relaxed breakfast\, o
 ther times a mini workshop or tasting. Every week brings something fresh t
 o the table.\n\n**We’ll bring the croissants… or quiche… honestly\, 
 it’s a surprise. You just bring your appetite!**\n\nCurious about CraftW
 ork? This is the perfect chance to explore! Meet the team\, mingle with th
 e community\, take a tour\, and grab a free day pass to actually get some 
 work done (seriously).\n\nQuestions about our space or events? More about 
 us via **craftworkhbg.com!**
LOCATION:CraftWork Healdsburg
URL:https://www.craftworkhbg.com/new-events
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
