  Green EGG complete outdoor cooking system. Each themed lunch focuses on h
 ow to use a wide range of cooking options\, from High-Temp Grilling\, Low 
 & Slow Smoker to Outdoor Oven\, while the St. Supéry team will discuss ho
 w to pair wines with seasonal produce and fruit as well as a variety of me
 at and fish depending on the lunch theme. This lunch shows you how to perf
 ectly pair wine and food no matter the season. Event includes reception\, 
