BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Karen Gebbia Kids Event Meet & Greet
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T150000
UID:260924QNwkIdMo6EG38WuJwOwAww
DESCRIPTION:Join us to celebrate Karen Gebbia's new picture book about wai
 ting patiently! And we'll be serving sweet tea as only our manager can mak
 e it\, so you won't have to wait for that!\n\n**So\, what's it about?**\n\
 nCharlotte wants to wait patiently. She really does. But waiting is hard\,
  especially on a stifling Maryland morning\, when her t-shirt feels like a
  hot\, heavy blanket\, and she can't think of anything but Nana's cold\, s
 weet\, lemony\, real iced tea.\n\nThere are so many steps to Nana's secret
  recipe tea! Steeping\, sugaring\, cooling . . . baking muffins to go with
  it! Nana tells her to find something useful to do while she waits\, so Ch
 arlotte sweeps\, and swings\, and snaps pillowcases\, but it still isn't r
 eady!\n\nCharlotte has to find more things to do to pass the time\, and so
 on she finds that a day spent waiting can be a day spent enjoying the slow
 er moments. Sometimes the sweetest things in life are the things we have t
 o wait for\, and learning to savor them slowly is a joy all its own. Inclu
 ded is a reader's note for adults on helping kids learn how to wait and a 
 secret recipe to try at home.\n\n**Author info!**\n\n**Karen Gebbia** is a
  children's book writer and naturalist based in California. Before writing
  for children\, Karen spent two decades writing\, publishing\, editing\, a
 nd teaching scholarly writing.
LOCATION:Copperfield's Books- Petaluma
URL:https://copperfieldsbooks.com/event/2026-10-17/karen-gebbia-meet-greet
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
