BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:In Conversation: M. Louise Stanley and Maria Porges
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T150000
UID:260919zdIOodtLTEqPao602daMag
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an illuminating conversation between artist M. Lou
 ise Stanley and artist and writer Maria Porges as they explore works in Th
 e Real-Life Art History of M. Louise Stanley. Stanley will reflect on her 
 five-decade practice\, distinctive humor\, and playful engagement with art
  history\, mythology\, feminism\, and contemporary life. Maria Porges brin
 gs the perspective of both an accomplished artist and longtime art writer 
 whose work has appeared in Artforum\, Art in America\, the New York Times 
 Book Review\, and Hyperallergic. A recipient of SFMOMA’s SECA Award\, Po
 rges has exhibited widely and is a professor at California College of the 
 Arts. Saturday\, Oct 17\, 3 PM $25 SVMA Members | $30 non-members Pre-regi
 stration is required.
LOCATION:Sonoma Valley Museum of Art
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1419583396723164/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Closing Cocktails: Illumination in Glass
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T200000
UID:260919EVLz4BJH0EqmxwX7ljY3jw
DESCRIPTION:ONE LAST GATHERING • CLOSING COCKTAILS\n\nAll things must co
 me to pass—and Maria Isabel Lopez closes this chapter with a heart full 
 of gratitude.\n\nJoin us for one last peek at Lopez’s mosaics\, one last
  evening to celebrate Illumination in Glass\, and the beautiful journey th
 is exhibition has been.\n\nSome pieces have already found their homes\, wh
 ile a few are still waiting for the right home to find them.\n\nCome raise
  a glass with us as Kabayan Wines pours their beautiful wines\, accompanie
 d by live music and good company.\n\nClosing Cocktail Saturday\, October 1
 7 • 5–8 PM Usher Gallery\, Petaluma\n\nCome for the art. Stay for the 
 wine and music. And help us celebrate this chapter before the lights go do
 wn.
LOCATION:Usher Gallery
URL:https://ushergallerypetaluma.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
