DESCRIPTION:**Calling All Movie Buffs!**\n\nGet ready for a thrilling week
 end at the Hitchcock Film Festival.\n\nJoin us at the Bodega Bay Grange Ha
 ll #777 for a celebration of one of cinema’s greatest artists\, Alfred H
 itchcock\, whose work continues to entertain and influence audiences\, fil
 mmakers\, authors and musicians on a global basis. The opportunity to see 
 "The Birds" in Bodega Bay\, where scenes for the film were shot\, is a pri
 vilege not to be missed. Other showings include "Rear Window" and "Rebecca
 ."\n\nSpirts\, wine\, beer\, concessions\, and food available for purchase
 .  \n\nHitchcock-Themed Photo-Ops\, Costume Contest & More\n\nWe will hav
 e student art on display\, plus T-shirts and other items for sale.
