 at American Song Book. We play a mix of uplifting swing tunes\, smooth Lat
 in tunes\, and soulful blues and ballads. Michele Korb is our vocalist/gui
 tarist. Susanne DiVincenzo is on bass. Barb Raboy plays clarinet\, sax\, a
 nd flute.\n\n**Details**\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this even
